WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.003
Wukong gasped as his companions began to look ill.

2
00:00:08.004 --> 00:00:13.744
The Tang Monk's head bobbed forward, and his teacup dropped from his hand.

3
00:00:13.745 --> 00:00:16.284
[g@And then—[i@thump!@i]

4
00:00:16.285 --> 00:00:18.555
The monk toppled to the floor.@g]

5
00:00:18.556 --> 00:00:25.459
A moment later Wujing and Bajie passed out too.

6
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:31.078
"Evil villain!" Wukong jumped to his feet and pulled out his iron bar.

7
00:00:31.079 --> 00:00:33.150
The priest backed away.

8
00:00:33.151 --> 00:00:39.130
Just then a door burst open, and the three women ran into the room.

9
00:00:39.131 --> 00:00:41.837
"You again?" cried the monkey.

10
00:00:41.838 --> 00:00:45.676
He leaped out of the way as the women shot webs at him.

11
00:00:45.677 --> 00:00:51.098
He jumped up, did a flip in the air, and landed directly behind the women.

12
00:00:51.099 --> 00:00:54.288
Furiously, he slammed his iron bar down.

13
00:00:54.289 --> 00:00:58.341
[i@Wham!@i] There was a puff of smoke.

14
00:00:58.342 --> 00:01:03.641
When it cleared, a dead spider lay where one of the women had been.

15
00:01:03.642 --> 00:01:06.596
The other two women stared in horror.

16
00:01:06.597 --> 00:01:09.751
"He destroyed our sister!" cried one.

17
00:01:09.752 --> 00:01:13.571
"He's a monster!" cried the other.

18
00:01:13.572 --> 00:01:15.889
Wukong charged toward them.

19
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:22.715
He knocked flying webs out of his way and then . . . [i@Crack! Bam!@i]

20
00:01:22.716 --> 00:01:25.090
[g@Both women were gone.

21
00:01:25.091 --> 00:01:29.217
In their places lay dead spiders.@g]

22
00:01:29.218 --> 00:01:33.572
"Those spider spirits were my dear friends!" cried the priest.

23
00:01:33.573 --> 00:01:36.509
[g@His eyes burned with fury.

24
00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.838
"You will regret destroying them."@g]

25
00:01:39.839 --> 00:01:44.916
The priest opened his robe, revealing a body covered in eyes.

26
00:01:44.917 --> 00:01:50.385
Suddenly, blinding light shot from the many eyes.

27
00:01:50.386 --> 00:01:55.651
"Aargh! The light is too bright!" cried the monkey.

28
00:01:55.652 --> 00:01:59.939
He covered his own eyes and ran all over the room.

29
00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:03.482
But he couldn't escape the blinding light.

30
00:02:03.483 --> 00:02:08.129
Finally he slammed his iron bar into the abbey's stone floor.

31
00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:11.334
[g@A huge hole opened up.

32
00:02:11.335 --> 00:02:15.734
The monkey jumped in and turned into a mole.@g]

33
00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:21.240
Using his claws, he tunneled until he was sure he was far from the abbey.

34
00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:26.548
When Wukong popped up out of the ground, he turned back into himself.

35
00:02:26.549 --> 00:02:29.808
Bright light was shining from the abbey.

36
00:02:29.809 --> 00:02:34.121
Even from far away, the light burned the monkey's eyes.

37
00:02:34.122 --> 00:02:36.737
Wukong turned away.

38
00:02:36.738 --> 00:02:38.494
[g@"What will I do?

39
00:02:38.495 --> 00:02:41.062
I have no way to save my friends.@g]

40
00:02:41.063 --> 00:02:44.512
That priest's light is too powerful."

41
00:02:44.513 --> 00:02:48.093
[g@He sobbed and sobbed until he heard a voice say,

42
00:02:48.094 --> 00:02:50.604
"Don't cry, Wukong."@g]

43
00:02:50.605 --> 00:02:52.234
[g@The monkey looked up.

44
00:02:52.235 --> 00:02:55.955
A tall woman was standing over him.@g]

45
00:02:55.956 --> 00:02:59.757
"I am the bodhisattva Pralambra," said the woman.

46
00:02:59.758 --> 00:03:05.259
"That priest is a centipede spirit, called the Demon Lord of Many Eyes.

47
00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:09.345
I am the only one who can defeat him."

48
00:03:09.346 --> 00:03:12.981
Pralambra pulled a small needle from her sleeve.

49
00:03:12.982 --> 00:03:16.433
Turning, she threw the needle into the beams of light.

50
00:03:16.434 --> 00:03:25.204
[i@Crack!@i] The sound thundered in the sky, and the beams of light vanished.

51
00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:29.363
Wukong and Pralambra returned to the abbey.

52
00:03:29.364 --> 00:03:32.032
[g@The priest lay shaking on the floor.

53
00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:35.212
All of his eyes were squeezed shut.@g]

54
00:03:35.213 --> 00:03:41.762
Pralambra pointed her finger at the priest, and he turned into a giant centipede.

55
00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:44.947
Pralambra took a bottle out of her sleeve.

56
00:03:44.948 --> 00:03:47.925
"Here, Wukong," said the bodhisattva.

57
00:03:47.926 --> 00:03:51.148
"These pills will cure your companions.

58
00:03:51.149 --> 00:03:55.845
I will take the centipede with me to be punished."

59
00:03:55.846 --> 00:04:05.048
Wukong bowed. "Thank you, Bodhisattva."

60
00:04:05.049 --> 00:04:09.285
The journey continued, and many weeks went by.

61
00:04:09.286 --> 00:04:13.560
"The journey has been easy lately," said the Tang Monk one day.

62
00:04:13.561 --> 00:04:16.119
Bajie snorted.

63
00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.408
"That's true," said Wujing.

64
00:04:18.409 --> 00:04:23.066
"It's been weeks since any demons tried to eat Master."

65
00:04:23.067 --> 00:04:27.970
"The Western Paradise is still far away," Wukong warned the others.

66
00:04:27.971 --> 00:04:31.668
"We'll face many more dangers before we get there."

67
00:04:31.669 --> 00:04:33.934
The Tang Monk smiled.

68
00:04:33.935 --> 00:04:37.591
[g@"Relax, Wukong, and enjoy the beautiful day.

69
00:04:37.592 --> 00:04:41.781
There is no danger here."@g]

70
00:04:41.782 --> 00:04:45.316
[g@Just then a man appeared up ahead.

71
00:04:45.317 --> 00:04:48.309
He was waving his arms frantically.@g]

72
00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:51.312
"Don't come this way!" shouted the man.

73
00:04:51.313 --> 00:04:59.225
"There's danger ahead—great danger!"

